Standalone executables (lexiftool-windows-<version>.zip,
lexiftool-macos-<version>.zip, lexiftool-linux-<version>.zip; built by
standalone/build.sh) and C API libraries (lexiftool-capi-windows-<version>.zip,
lexiftool-capi-macos-<version>.zip, lexiftool-capi-linux-<version>.zip;
built by capi/package.sh)

