linked or embedded: Lua 5.5.1, PCRE2 10.47, zlib 1.3.2, Brotli 1.2.0,
liblzma 5.8.4, libbz2 1.0.8, luafilesystem 1.9.0, digest 0.0.1, carray,
lpcre, compress.brotli, compress.zlib, compress.lzma and compress.bzip2
0.0.1, cipher.aes and cipher.rc4 0.0.1 (all listed above), the lexiftool
modules, Geolocation.dat and the character data of GCStringData.lua; builds
whose entries are zstd-compressed (SA_COMPRESS=zstd; the macOS and Windows
C API libraries) also the Zstandard 1.5.7 decoder. The full license text of
each third-party component, taken unchanged from its source distribution,
is in the licenses/ folder of the zip:

